WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Review a proposed change file by file. Keep what you want, reject the rest.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Approval binds to a hash of exactly what you saw. Change one character and it stops matching.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Checks run in a sandbox against the applied files. Exit codes decide, and a check that didn't run says so.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
A ProofPack records what ran, against which files, and what it doesn't prove.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Publishing needs a clean check of these exact files, then the live check confirms them.

6
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.000
An applied change can be undone, and the undo is recorded too.
